{
  "name": "Wattwisely",
  "version": 3,
  "source": "Approved 2026-10-27 (color scheme page v5). Matches the driver app design in Figma, section 7 'Mobile app · design system'; chip and notice colors read from its screens.",
  "howToEdit": "Change a hex value in palette and every role and status that names it follows; a role or status can also take a hex value directly. Then run `npx nx run theme:generate` and commit theme.json with the files it writes. Light mode only. The *Text colors are the darker shade of each hue, for small text on the soft backgrounds (WCAG AA).",
